<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">AI 找位助手</view>
    <view class="hero-tip">
      用一句话描述时间、人数和场地类型，帮你找最合适的空位。找不到会退回普通搜索。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <textarea
      class="ai-input"
      value="{{message}}"
      maxlength="500"
      auto-height
      placeholder="例如：明天下午 3 点，4 个人，找个研讨室开 1 小时"
      bindinput="onInput"
    />
    <view class="example-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{examples}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        class="example-chip"
        bindtap="useExample"
        data-text="{{item}}"
      >{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <button
      class="btn-primary"
      style="margin-top: 24rpx;"
      bindtap="ask"
      loading="{{loading}}"
    >帮我找空位</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{loaded}}">
    <view class="card interpretation-card">
      <view class="between">
        <view class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 0;">需求理解</view>
        <view class="tag tag-blue">{{sourceLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="interpretation-text">{{interpretationText}}</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 10rpx;">
        未配置大模型时使用内置规则解析，演示环境同样可用。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{note}}" class="card">
      <view class="muted">{{note}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="resourceId" class="card candidate-card">
      <view class="between">
        <view class="candidate-name">{{item.resourceName}}</view>
        <view class="tag tag-green">{{item.typeLabel}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 10rpx;">
        {{item.building}} {{item.room}} · 可容纳 {{item.capacity}} 人
      </view>
      <view class="candidate-time">{{item.timeText}}</view>
      <view class="candidate-reason">{{item.reason}}</view>
      <view class="candidate-actions">
        <button class="btn-ghost btn-small" bindtap="goVenue" data-index="{{index}}">看场地</button>
        <button class="btn-primary btn-small" bindtap="goBooking" data-index="{{index}}">去预约</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="rule-tip">
    AI 只负责理解你的需求，实际空位由系统实时查询数据库，避免推荐已被占用的时段。
  </view>
</view>
